COPY public.hegemony (title_id, decision, notes) FROM stdin;
h_china	Already present	Always uses the owner's dynasty name regardless of game settings If the All Under Heaven DLC is installed the title unlocks additional mechanics: Can only be destroyed and recreated via the Dynasty Cycle situation Unlocks a large number of great projects Uses the Grand Secretariat diarchy Tributary system is expanded Unlocks two additional laws if government remains Celestial Uses a different council if government remains Celestial
h_india	Become Chakravarti	
h_dar_al_islam	Establish the Dar al-Islam	Becomes the head of faith title for all Muslim faiths that consider the faith of the ruler taking the decision Righteous or Astray
h_roman_empire	Restore the Roman Empire	Owner has the Augustus trait Unlocks the Restore Imperial Province casus belli Reconquering historical provinces of the Roman Empire provides additional bonuses
h_eastern_roman_empire	Cleave the Empire	Owner has the Augustus trait
h_western_roman_empire	Cleave the Empire	Owner has the Augustus trait
h_khaganate	Reform the Great Khaganate	Additional empires are not added if the Expand the Steppes decision is taken after the hegemony has been created
